Description:
    Sets up a Mixin Messenger/Network Rails application in one command:
    "Sign in with Mixin" (OmniAuth), Blaze message routing with the Puma
    plugin, the outputs poller with an example processor, the outbound
    transfer ledger, and Noticed-driven Mixin notifications.

    Skip any component:

        rails generate mixin_bot:install --skip-notifications --skip-transfers
        rails generate mixin_bot:install --skip notifications,transfers
        rails generate mixin_bot:install --skip authentication

Example:
    rails generate mixin_bot:install

    This will run, in order:
        rails generate mixin_bot:authentication
        rails generate mixin_bot:blaze
        rails generate mixin_bot:outputs
        rails generate mixin_bot:transfers
        rails generate mixin_bot:notifications

    Afterwards: set your bot credentials, run `rails db:migrate`, and start
    the poller (`rails mixin_bot:poller`) and your job backend.
